,"desc":"Logseq is a joyful, open-source outliner that works on top of local plain-text Markdown and Org-mode files. Use it to write, organize and share your thoughts, keep your to-do list, and build your own digital garden.\n\nLogseq includes the following features:\n1. Backlink\n2. Knowledge Graph\n3. Page and block references\n4. Page and block embeds\n5. Tasks & Todos\n6. SRS Cards\n7. Zotero integration\n8. Youtube, Twitter, etc. integration\n9. Audio recorder\n10. Powerful queries\n11. Whiteboards","released":"2022-04-13","updated":"2024-04-23","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/0a/4a/ff/0a4affb6-7f92-b2cf-4e94-9990bb7a5891/AppIcon-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/0a/4a/ff/0a4affb6-7f92-b2cf-4e94-9990bb7a5891/AppIcon-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Productivity","rating":4.38,"ratings":265,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":3,"hn_comments":0,"submissions":1,"self_n":0,"hn_score":4.0,"first":1649889415,"last":1649889415,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":1,"pos_pct":0,"neg_pct":0,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":31021178,"k":"ios:1601013908","type":"story","by":"veidr","time":1649889415,"text":"","title":"Logseq iOS App","story_id":31021178,"story_title":"Logseq iOS App","story_score":3,"comments":0,"w":3.0,"u":0,"s":"neu","self":false}],"slug":"logseq"}